re reported-crime data with victimization data."}, {"id": "799050e3-efa1-4a7f-9174-fb86b29f9e21", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Hidden Victimization", "children": [{"id": "bf48aebd-b5cb-47a1-8c99-9f69cf164eab", "type": "concept", "title": "Stigma and fear"}, {"id": "b73bfab6-3687-4e3e-bf1c-8df74c0c1b67", "type": "concept", "title": "Power-dependent abuse"}, {"id": "fed5ab69-bbb8-4369-91e6-6a38f940cc67", "type": "concept", "title": "Language and access barriers"}], "description": "Students learn why some harms stay invisible."}]}, {"id": "5dd9330a-77ac-457a-ae39-cdb441c8bd43", "type": "topic", "title": "Theories of Victimization and Victim-Offender Relationships", "description": "This unit explains patterns of victimization without blaming victims. Students learn theories of exposure, opportunity, repeat victimization, and victim-offender overlap.", "children": [{"id": "c2bf37ba-a678-46ef-9ae4-5faff02b78c1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lifestyle and Routine Activities", "children": [{"id": "9438cc95-6cc8-4702-8dbd-fe30be50a07e", "type": "concept", "title": "Suitable targets"}, {"id": "d69c9d9d-3fb7-4284-929f-744ef9efd79c", "type": "concept", "title": "Guardianship"}, {"id": "ac0a12b0-6a04-4b67-ac07-0fe4e91357ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Time and place"}], "description": "Students examine how routine patterns affect risk exposure."}, {"id": "9fdefa67-84a5-4d69-83b3-4a722e3b7a8f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Repeat Victimization", "children": [{"id": "c3bc152a-4f2d-42ad-8808-2a66fbbd434b", "type": "concept", "title": "Near repeats"}, {"id": "513dda32-5ba9-441a-99af-1179c825daf6", "type": "concept", "title": "Chronic victimization"}, {"id": "de8850f5-81b9-4a27-b693-8254c6932254", "type": "concept", "title": "Prevention targeting"}], "description": "The gist is to understand why victimization can cluster over time and place."}, {"id": "1e9e1d3f-8ffd-48aa-a950-9034d20d5b96", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Victim-Offender Overlap", "children": [{"id": "228741ff-1f4